{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:browser-core:metadata-compare:1",
  "title": "Window comparison over one validated, value-free native metadata snapshot",
  "description": "Counts matching events in 2-8 recording-clock windows of one snapshot after full population validation. Rows key on API name and context kind. Window membership is time only and a zero count is not proof of non-execution. The CLI emits these ASCII bytes plus one newline, at most 16384 bytes.",
